@hostname=localhost
@port=4004
@host={{hostname}}:{{port}}
@service=/v2/catalog


### Rebates  - Get All Rebates
GET http://{{host}}{{service}}/Rebates
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t


### Rebates  - Get Contract by ID - ODATA V2
GET http://{{host}}{{service}}/Rebates(guid'12946ea7-fb94-4a26-80df-9ecbbd351eea')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

###Rebates  - Create new Contract
POST http://{{host}}{{service}}/Rebates
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

{
